{"v":1,"book":"Eccl","ch":10,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Dead flies cause the perfumer’s ointment to stink, to ferment; so a little folly outweighs wisdom and honor.","tok":[{"t":"Dead","s":["H4194"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flies","s":["H2070"],"a":[0]},{"t":" cause the perfumer’s "},{"t":"ointment","s":["H8081"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to stink, to ferment; so a "},{"t":"little","s":["H4592"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"folly","s":["H5531"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"outweighs","s":["H3368"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"honor","s":["H3519"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"A wise man’s heart inclines to his right, but a fool’s heart inclines to his left.","tok":[{"t":"A wise "},{"t":"man’s","s":["H2450"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[0]},{"t":" inclines to his right, but a "},{"t":"fool’s","s":["H3684"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[3]},{"t":" inclines to his "},{"t":"left","s":["H8040"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And also, when the fool walks on the way, his sense fails him, and he tells everyone that he is a fool.","tok":[{"t":"And also, when the "},{"t":"fool","s":["H5530"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"walks","s":["H1980"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[1]},{"t":", his sense "},{"t":"fails","s":["H2638"]},{"t":" him, and he tells everyone that he is a "},{"t":"fool","s":["H5530"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"If the ruler’s spirit rises up against you, do not leave your place; for composure allays great offenses.","tok":[{"t":"If the ruler’s "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rises","s":["H4910"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[3]},{"t":" against you, do not "},{"t":"leave","s":["H3240"]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; for composure allays "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"offenses","s":["H2399"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"There is an evil that I have see