{"t":"endangered","s":["H5533"],"a":[6]},{"t":" by them."}]},{"n":10,"text":"If the iron is blunt, and one does not whet the edge, then he must apply more strength; but wisdom has the advantage of giving success.","tok":[{"t":"If the "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"blunt","s":["H6949"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and one does not "},{"t":"whet","s":["H7043"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"edge","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":", then he must apply more "},{"t":"strength","s":["H2428"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; but "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[11]},{"t":" has the advantage of giving success."}]},{"n":11,"text":"If the serpent bites before it is charmed, then there is no advantage in a charmer.","tok":[{"t":"If the "},{"t":"serpent","s":["H5175"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"bites","s":["H5391"],"a":[1]},{"t":" before it is charmed, then there is no advantage in a charmer."}]},{"n":12,"text":"The words of a wise man’s mouth are gracious, but the lips of a fool swallow him up.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of a wise "},{"t":"man’s","s":["H2450"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"gracious","s":["H2580"],"a":[3]},{"t":", but the "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"fool","s":["H3684"],"a":[5]},{"t":" swallow him "},{"t":"up","s":["H1104"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"The beginning of the words of his mouth is folly, and the end of his talk is wicked madness.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"beginning","s":["H8462"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"folly","s":["H5531"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"end","s":["H0319"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"talk","s":["H6310"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"madness","s":["H1948"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Yet the fool multiplies words. No man knows what will be; and what wil