{"t":" the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"leaks","s":["H1811"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"They make a feast for laughter, and wine makes life merry, and money is the answer to everything.","tok":[{"t":"They make a "},{"t":"feast","s":["H3899"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"laughter","s":["H7814"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[3]},{"t":" makes life "},{"t":"merry","s":["H8055"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"money","s":["H3701"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"answer","s":["H6030"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to everything."}]},{"n":20,"text":"Do not curse the king even in your thought, and do not curse a rich man in your bedroom; for a bird of heaven will carry the sound, or something with wings will tell the matter.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7043"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[2]},{"t":" even in your "},{"t":"thought","s":["H4093"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and do not "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7043"],"a":[8]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"rich","s":["H6223"],"a":[9]},{"t":" man in your bedroom; for a "},{"t":"bird","s":["H5775"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of heaven will "},{"t":"carry","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" the sound, or something with "},{"t":"wings","s":["H3671"],"a":[17]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"tell","s":["H5046"],"a":[18]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"matter","s":["H1697"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]}]}
